1
00:00:01,180 --> 00:00:03,060
You could even win a reward!

2
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:11,625
We're on our way, racing towards
the village at breakneck speed.

3
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:14,917
Between Shimei Lai using his wind
magic to make the wagon hover,

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,497
and Lammis and Director Bear
pushing with all their might,

5
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:20,168
we might get there way
sooner than expected.

6
00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:22,200
And so round two begins.

7
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:25,557
Struggle against me with all
your might, you will not lord me!

8
00:00:25,640 --> 00:00:28,237
Give your lives and
your power to my cause!

9
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:31,908
We've got to get back fast and
stop him from getting his way!

10
00:00:38,820 --> 00:00:43,644
On the outside, I'm just a big metal box,
but inside, I've still got a human soul!

11
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:44,917
In this new world of wonders,

12
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,957
I travel to and fro on the back
of my super strong partner,

13
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:48,870
Lamas!

14
00:00:48,953 --> 00:00:50,920
The name's Boxo. Hello there!

15
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:52,900
That means yes, by the way.

16
00:01:37,700 --> 00:01:39,017
I'll

17
00:01:39,100 --> 00:01:40,417
see

18
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:47,237
you

19
00:01:47,320 --> 00:01:54,320
next

20
00:01:57,700 --> 00:01:58,530
time.

21
00:02:07,860 --> 00:02:11,197
It didn't take us long at all to
get back to the transfer circle.

22
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:14,280
Thanks to Lamas and Director
Bear running non-stop.

23
00:02:14,980 --> 00:02:19,862
Meanwhile, Captain Kerioyl and the school
director went back to the Origin Stratum.

24
00:02:24,900 --> 00:02:25,730
Director!

25
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:27,390
Rector!

26
00:02:27,473 --> 00:02:28,937
The trouble started while you were away.

27
00:02:29,020 --> 00:02:30,340
I'm so sorry.

28
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:32,092
Give me all the details.

29
00:02:32,300 --> 00:02:33,240
Yes, sir.

30
00:02:33,500 --> 00:02:36,794
A few days ago, a swarm of
monsters came out of nowhere.

31
00:02:37,080 --> 00:02:41,139
We tried, but we weren't able to
stop them from invading the village.

32
00:02:41,340 --> 00:02:45,105
Most of the residents unfortunately
couldn't get inside in time.

33
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:48,317
I know this is difficult, but
you must tell me everything.

34
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:51,157
It's imperative that I hear
even the smallest piece,

35
00:02:51,240 --> 00:02:53,240
so we know exactly where we stand.

36
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:54,350
Yes, sir.

37
00:02:54,460 --> 00:02:58,417
We tried to activate the transfer circle,
but it wouldn't work for some reason.

38
00:02:58,500 --> 00:03:01,900
Please tell me these aren't
the only survivors. No, sir.

39
00:03:02,140 --> 00:03:03,817
There are more upstairs in private rooms.

40
00:03:03,900 --> 00:03:07,577
The mothers with very young children,
the badly wounded, and more.

41
00:03:07,660 --> 00:03:09,517
Then there are the hunters, too.

42
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:12,835
We have them on guard duty
on the second floor terrace.

43
00:03:13,180 --> 00:03:14,010
I see.

44
00:03:14,093 --> 00:03:15,077
You've done well, comrade.

45
00:03:15,160 --> 00:03:16,217
Now get some rest.

46
00:03:16,300 --> 00:03:17,130
We can...

47
00:03:17,500 --> 00:03:18,330
Director!

48
00:03:18,413 --> 00:03:20,217
We'll go help with guard
duty on the terrace.

49
00:03:20,300 --> 00:03:24,476
We can better assess the situation
from up there too as gate guardians.

50
00:03:24,700 --> 00:03:25,530
That's our job.

51
00:03:25,613 --> 00:03:27,401
I'll assist in defending the town

52
00:03:27,940 --> 00:03:28,877
I'm coming too.

53
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:32,760
I may have old man magic, but it
always comes through in a pinch

54
00:03:33,480 --> 00:03:35,397
Watch out old lady on your heels.

55
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:39,397
Someone up there is sure to need some
healing I want to help you guys with defense.

56
00:03:39,480 --> 00:03:41,000
No Lamas and Boxer.

57
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:43,473
We need your help with meal distribution

58
00:03:45,260 --> 00:03:48,297
It doesn't seem like anybody's
been eating all that much.

59
00:03:48,380 --> 00:03:49,210
Hello there.

60
00:03:49,293 --> 00:03:50,123
Oh

61
00:03:50,460 --> 00:03:51,480
Okay, poor Lamas.

62
00:03:51,660 --> 00:03:55,577
I bet she's worried sick and wants
to find Munami, her pal from the inn.

63
00:03:55,660 --> 00:03:57,917
If she went in a battle with
that weighing on her mind,

64
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:00,059
she'd probably just mess things up.

65
00:04:00,420 --> 00:04:02,260
Whoa, what's going on?

66
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:04,160
Is Boxo doing all this?

67
00:04:05,640 --> 00:04:08,197
Wow, this water is so cold and tasty!

68
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:09,597
It is so delicious too!

69
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:10,960
Thanks so much, Boxo.

70
00:04:11,140 --> 00:04:14,257
The resilience of these people
never ceases to amaze me.

71
00:04:14,340 --> 00:04:16,717
Makes me want to do my
vending machine best!

72
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:19,180
All right, Boxo, on to the second floor!

73
00:04:19,980 --> 00:04:20,980
Hey, everybody!

74
00:04:21,460 --> 00:04:22,940
Cold drinks and hot food!

75
00:04:23,140 --> 00:04:24,081
Come and get it!

76
00:04:28,760 --> 00:04:29,590
Hello!

77
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:31,517
We've got food and drinks out here.

78
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:33,160
It's the big strong lady!

79
00:04:33,820 --> 00:04:35,761
Are Grandma and Grandpa with you?

80
00:04:35,900 --> 00:04:36,730
Mm-hmm.

81
00:04:36,813 --> 00:04:38,837
Yumite and Shimelai
are both safe and well.

82
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:39,750
Don't worry.

83
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:41,830
They're okay!

84
00:04:41,913 --> 00:04:43,260
I'm so happy!

85
00:04:45,380 --> 00:04:46,210
Lamas!

86
00:04:46,320 --> 00:04:47,797
Hey, look who I found!

87
00:04:47,880 --> 00:04:50,577
Yumite and Shimalai's
daughter and granddaughter.

88
00:04:50,660 --> 00:04:51,617
And they're both safe.

89
00:04:51,700 --> 00:04:52,530
Amazing.

90
00:04:52,660 --> 00:04:55,077
Karyos' girlfriend, the
exchange house gang,

91
00:04:55,160 --> 00:04:58,017
and that domineering blonde
girl, they're all safe.

92
00:04:58,100 --> 00:04:59,240
Oh, also... Mommy!

93
00:05:00,060 --> 00:05:03,000
I've never been so happy
to see you! Munami!

94
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:05,660
Thank goodness! I missed you!

95
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:12,557
Boxxo, I want to let the elderly
fighters know their girls are safe.

96
00:05:12,640 --> 00:05:13,934
Could you help me out?

97
00:05:14,060 --> 00:05:14,942
How about that?

98
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:16,840
Okay. Form change!

99
00:05:17,880 --> 00:05:18,710
Nice.

100
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:20,380
I appreciate you, Voxo.

101
00:05:32,660 --> 00:05:34,700
No, this can't be.

102
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:38,647
Look at what those monsters have
done to our precious village.

103
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:41,580
You and me, I'm devastated too.

104
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:45,460
But right now, we've got
important work at hand.

105
00:05:54,880 --> 00:05:57,527
Who knew Shirley and
Goat Guy were so strong?

106
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:58,980
A gobsmacked!

107
00:05:59,960 --> 00:06:01,300
Hey, old-timers!

108
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:03,597
Your daughter and granddaughter are safe!

109
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:06,300
And Karios, your girl is too! Aye!

110
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:19,040
Boring strike!

111
00:06:24,080 --> 00:06:25,857
Everyone's doing everything they can.

112
00:06:25,940 --> 00:06:27,680
I can't let them show me up.

113
00:06:27,840 --> 00:06:29,017
Is everyone all right?

114
00:06:29,100 --> 00:06:30,276
Boxer, are you okay?

115
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:32,557
Are all your parts working
and in the right place?

116
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:33,470
Hello there.

117
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:34,540
Yulami, you two?

118
00:06:35,520 --> 00:06:37,580
Looks like Lamas is feeling better.

119
00:06:38,500 --> 00:06:41,240
The only safe place for
you to rest is inside.

120
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:44,179
I'll take care of things from here.

121
00:06:44,620 --> 00:06:46,620
All right, it's fighting time.

122
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:50,299
I guess seeing Moon in me
really boosted her morale.

123
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:52,700
Hey, Lamas, nice to see you.

124
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:54,120
Sure, good to see you.

125
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:55,772
Wow, I love that outfit.

126
00:06:56,220 --> 00:06:57,279
Thank you so much.

127
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:59,177
Had to come take a quick break.

128
00:06:59,260 --> 00:07:00,090
Hold up there.

129
00:07:01,460 --> 00:07:04,480
Whoa, how did you, uh, was
that your magic, Lamas?

130
00:07:04,640 --> 00:07:07,360
Nope, that was courtesy of Boxo. Really?

131
00:07:07,780 --> 00:07:08,800
Boxo did this?

132
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:10,520
Well then, thank you.

133
00:07:10,840 --> 00:07:12,740
You seem like a top-notch guy.

134
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:14,807
Too bad you're a magic item.

135
00:07:15,020 --> 00:07:15,850
Wow.

136
00:07:15,933 --> 00:07:18,357
If I weren't a box, I
might get the wrong idea.

137
00:07:18,440 --> 00:07:19,270
Right.

138
00:07:19,353 --> 00:07:20,797
Time for Boxo and me to hold the line.

139
00:07:20,880 --> 00:07:22,897
You go take a long nap, okay, Shirley?

140
00:07:22,980 --> 00:07:25,917
You always say lack of sleep
is the arch-enemy of beauty.

141
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:28,197
Dang, I feel called
out, but I can't argue.

142
00:07:28,280 --> 00:07:30,221
Okay, time to slay some monsters.

143
00:07:40,660 --> 00:07:41,537
Incredible, Lumet.

144
00:07:41,620 --> 00:07:45,217
I would love to transform into a power
washer and help everyone out there,

145
00:07:45,300 --> 00:07:49,006
but I'd better keep that one in
my back pocket for time's sake.

146
00:07:50,320 --> 00:07:52,379
The defensive wall's been breached?

147
00:07:52,500 --> 00:07:54,853
Is that how the monsters are getting in?

148
00:08:01,780 --> 00:08:04,340
Hey, Boxxo, may I have some water?

149
00:08:04,820 --> 00:08:08,280
Lammis, are you tired
out already? Oh, right.

150
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:10,737
She ran all the way home
without stopping to rest.

151
00:08:10,820 --> 00:08:12,480
Of course she's exhausted.

152
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:16,428
Right, ready for round two.

153
00:08:16,660 --> 00:08:17,797
All thanks to you, Boxo.

154
00:08:17,880 --> 00:08:20,020
And you too, Lamas. Let's go!

155
00:08:21,140 --> 00:08:22,120
Get ready!

156
00:08:22,820 --> 00:08:23,760
Yeah, me too.

157
00:08:24,080 --> 00:08:25,560
Too bad, too bad.

158
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:27,212
You're pushing too hard.

159
00:08:27,380 --> 00:08:28,940
You've got to rest, Lamas.

160
00:08:29,280 --> 00:08:30,260
No, Boxo.

161
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:32,560
I want to keep going to save them.

162
00:08:32,800 --> 00:08:33,640
I won't run.

163
00:08:33,920 --> 00:08:35,332
I'll fight till the end.

164
00:08:35,520 --> 00:08:36,873
I can protect everyone.

165
00:08:37,220 --> 00:08:39,220
It won't be like when I was small.

166
00:08:39,500 --> 00:08:40,740
Oh, Lamas.

167
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:45,940
Long ago, our village was attacked,
wiped out by a horde of monsters.

168
00:08:46,900 --> 00:08:50,460
Few survived, but Lamas and I
were among the ones who did.

169
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:54,249
Our parents, though,
they weren't so lucky.

170
00:08:54,560 --> 00:08:58,117
This is bringing Lamas back to
when her old village was destroyed.

171
00:08:58,200 --> 00:09:02,940
I can understand the feeling, but if she
keeps pushing this hard, she could die.

172
00:09:04,900 --> 00:09:05,730
Okay.

173
00:09:05,900 --> 00:09:07,080
I have to stop her.

174
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:09,437
Now's my chance to try
what I've been practicing.

175
00:09:09,520 --> 00:09:11,060
No time like the present!

176
00:09:11,280 --> 00:09:12,339
Here goes nothing!

177
00:09:12,900 --> 00:09:14,200
Lammis.

178
00:09:16,240 --> 00:09:17,520
Stay back.

179
00:09:18,060 --> 00:09:19,520
Oh, yeah.

180
00:09:19,860 --> 00:09:22,580
I should maybe stay back, huh?

181
00:09:25,100 --> 00:09:26,297
But, uh...

182
00:09:26,380 --> 00:09:27,500
Bokshu!

183
00:09:28,760 --> 00:09:31,220
Did you just say my name? You did!

184
00:09:31,380 --> 00:09:32,357
Didn't you, Bokshu?

185
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:34,500
When did you learn to talk?

186
00:09:36,820 --> 00:09:38,817
Llamas was so shocked that I spoke,

187
00:09:38,900 --> 00:09:41,597
she screamed her head off
and then promptly passed out.

188
00:09:41,680 --> 00:09:45,557
Guess that development really pushed
her mind and body over the edge.

189
00:09:45,640 --> 00:09:46,660
Rest up, Llamas.

190
00:09:49,420 --> 00:09:50,520
Hey, Boxo.

191
00:09:50,740 --> 00:09:53,297
Did I just hear Llamas
yelling what I think I did?

192
00:09:53,380 --> 00:09:55,740
Something about how you could talk? Yes.

193
00:09:56,980 --> 00:09:58,320
Wait, what? Really?

194
00:09:59,640 --> 00:10:01,340
Only a bit.

195
00:10:02,620 --> 00:10:04,620
Oh, so that means what?

196
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:07,657
That you can talk a bit,
just not quite fluently?

197
00:10:07,740 --> 00:10:08,570
Yes.

198
00:10:08,800 --> 00:10:10,837
So that halting way you're speaking,

199
00:10:10,920 --> 00:10:14,257
is it because there are limits to
what syllables you have to draw from?

200
00:10:14,340 --> 00:10:17,575
It really is helpful that
she's so quick on the uptake.

201
00:10:18,340 --> 00:10:19,170
Hello there.

202
00:10:19,400 --> 00:10:20,600
Thank you very much.

203
00:10:21,120 --> 00:10:23,320
I look forward to serving you again.

204
00:10:23,700 --> 00:10:25,680
You could even win a reward.

205
00:10:26,060 --> 00:10:27,020
Too bad.

206
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:28,240
You win.

207
00:10:28,660 --> 00:10:30,160
Please insert coins.

208
00:10:31,340 --> 00:10:32,260
I get it.

209
00:10:32,460 --> 00:10:34,557
You can take parts of
the words you use in your

210
00:10:34,640 --> 00:10:37,287
stock phrases and create
new words from them.

211
00:10:37,540 --> 00:10:38,580
Yes, yes.

212
00:10:39,060 --> 00:10:41,157
You're only saying a few sounds at a time.

213
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:42,797
Is that all you can manage?

214
00:10:42,880 --> 00:10:46,800
K-lo-s-ba-it-ni-ot-k-wo-ite.

215
00:10:47,280 --> 00:10:50,633
When I say sections of my
canned phrases, it sounds fine.

216
00:10:50,740 --> 00:10:53,297
But when I string individual
syllables together,

217
00:10:53,380 --> 00:10:56,317
it always ends up sounding
like an old-school robot voice.

218
00:10:56,400 --> 00:10:57,280
I understand.

219
00:10:57,600 --> 00:10:59,377
Or I think I do, for the most part.

220
00:10:59,460 --> 00:11:01,480
That's incredible, though, Boxo.

221
00:11:01,820 --> 00:11:04,377
Now you can communicate
much better than before.

222
00:11:04,460 --> 00:11:07,157
I know that Lamas is
going to be over the moon.

223
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:10,880
I mean, I'm over the moon, too, obviously.

224
00:11:11,340 --> 00:11:12,811
There's so much to learn.

225
00:11:13,100 --> 00:11:15,218
I want to know everything about you.

226
00:11:15,540 --> 00:11:19,377
It must feel so awkward for her to
say such un-Hula-me-like things.

227
00:11:19,460 --> 00:11:23,872
While I would love to sit and enjoy
this conversation, now is not the time.

228
00:11:27,180 --> 00:11:30,180
You want to go back out to
the terrace? You got it.

229
00:11:32,800 --> 00:11:37,040
I don't ever get tired, so I'm the
best guy for tests of endurance?

230
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:39,085
because I'm a vending machine!

231
00:11:39,540 --> 00:11:44,240
I can't stay transformed longer than
the time limit, but I can still do this!

232
00:11:49,140 --> 00:11:52,340
That old favorite, cola and mint candy.

233
00:11:52,520 --> 00:11:53,860
Cola Bombs!

234
00:12:03,440 --> 00:12:05,957
how's that cola spray
feels great in those big

235
00:12:06,040 --> 00:12:09,160
dumb monster eyes there's
more where that came from

236
00:12:13,580 --> 00:12:16,657
boxo apparently the monster horde
typically retreats in the early

237
00:12:16,740 --> 00:12:20,377
evening so they can launch a fierce
late night attack that means we had to

238
00:12:20,460 --> 00:12:23,737
put up a late night defense there
was unanimous agreement not to ask

239
00:12:23,820 --> 00:12:27,938
too much of our elderly hunters
director bear hadn't gotten any sleep.

240
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:32,120
So he's zonked out on Hulumi's super
strong homemade sleep medicine.

241
00:12:33,920 --> 00:12:35,080
Heads up, comrades.

242
00:12:35,400 --> 00:12:38,459
Four creatures incoming,
and they're moving quickly.

243
00:12:44,340 --> 00:12:45,740
Guess who's back?

244
00:12:46,260 --> 00:12:48,731
Oh, looks like everyone else is back, too.

245
00:12:49,640 --> 00:12:50,660
It's Boxo.

246
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:53,417
Give us something real tasty
to eat right now, Boxo.

247
00:12:53,500 --> 00:12:56,857
I'm glad to see the band of gluttons
demanding food before celebrating our reunion.

248
00:12:56,940 --> 00:12:59,175
means they're feeling like themselves.

249
00:12:59,460 --> 00:13:01,720
Behold, your favorite fried chicken!

250
00:13:03,020 --> 00:13:03,980
We looked!

251
00:13:04,460 --> 00:13:05,420
All around!

252
00:13:06,140 --> 00:13:08,787
Save it for when you're
done eating, Mikenne.

253
00:13:10,380 --> 00:13:11,340
Where was I?

254
00:13:11,620 --> 00:13:15,397
Oh, right, so we ran around the village
looking for survivors of the attack.

255
00:13:15,480 --> 00:13:18,197
But no matter where we
went, we couldn't find any.

256
00:13:18,280 --> 00:13:22,077
And as far as the monsters, they're
gathered together near a big hole?

257
00:13:22,160 --> 00:13:23,217
they made in the wall.

258
00:13:23,300 --> 00:13:25,217
And more and more keep showing up.

259
00:13:25,300 --> 00:13:29,065
We saw several big ones way off
in the distance headed this way.

260
00:13:29,560 --> 00:13:32,997
Wow, these little guys were
running around in this danger zone?

261
00:13:33,080 --> 00:13:36,097
Which means it's reasonable
to assume we can expect the

262
00:13:36,180 --> 00:13:39,356
King Frog Fiends to show up
tomorrow or the day after.

263
00:13:41,800 --> 00:13:44,506
Comrades, we must focus
on the task before us.

264
00:13:44,680 --> 00:13:47,737
And while there isn't much I can
do, I swear I'll give it my all.

265
00:13:47,820 --> 00:13:52,017
With our combined strength, I know we
can dispose of these Fel Fiends handily.

266
00:13:52,100 --> 00:13:53,617
Wow, he nailed that speech.

267
00:13:53,700 --> 00:13:56,517
He's really charming when
he goes into manly mode.

268
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:58,977
Now, if he could just do
something about that trembling,

269
00:13:59,060 --> 00:14:00,825
clenched fist, he'd be golden.

270
00:14:01,180 --> 00:14:03,977
Mishuel's trying his best,
despite his awkward ways.

271
00:14:04,060 --> 00:14:05,119
You heard the man.

272
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:06,940
No taking reckless risks.

273
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:10,007
If you get hurt, get
back inside immediately.

274
00:14:10,740 --> 00:14:12,797
Reinforcement hunters and
the healing squad will

275
00:14:12,880 --> 00:14:15,645
